4,9,"activity, chosen, convenient, preparation, rough",aries (22.2%),"1314, 1463, 3054, 3203, 4794, 4943, 6683, 8423, 21534",Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead...,"Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead. There is almost no physical activity that you wouldn't enjoy, so pick the one that is most convenient for you on a practical level. There should be little or no obstacles in the path of getting this exercise. Build up a practice around this chosen activity and use it as your support for when the going gets rough. Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead. There is almost no physical activity that you wouldn't enjoy, so pick the one that is most convenient for you on a practical level. There should be little or no obstacles in the path of getting this exercise. Build up a practice around this chosen activity and use it as your support for when the going gets rough. Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead. There is almost no physical activity that you wouldn't enjoy, so pick the one that is most convenient for you on a practical level. There should be little or no obstacles in the path of getting this exercise. Build up a practice around this chosen activity and use it as your support for when the going gets rough. Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead. There is almost no physical activity that you wouldn't enjoy, so pick the one that is most convenient for you on a practical level. There should be little or no obstacles in the path of getting this exercise. Build up a practice around this chosen activity and use it as your support for when the going gets rough. Knowing how to care for yourself takes preparation! Bring out the best in yourself by planning ahead. 