830,4,"taking, crisis, maxim, care, tiny",aries (25.0%),"1108, 17848, 19588, 21328","When we feel confident, it's tempting to give advice, or in many cases, to start taking care of othe...","When we feel confident, it's tempting to give advice, or in many cases, to start taking care of others. Be careful -this can be dangerous. There is no certainty that our health tomorrow will be the same as today; we must always maintain a humble attitude and serve our bodies each day. That natural human laziness can be overcome with a tiny bit of discipline. Avoid taking care of others in place of yourself. If you live according to this maxim, you will ultimately be a better friend, as you will be available and strong in times of crisis and need. When we feel confident, it's tempting to give advice, or in many cases, to start taking care of others. Be careful -this can be dangerous. There is no certainty that our health tomorrow will be the same as today; we must always maintain a humble attitude and serve our bodies each day. That natural human laziness can be overcome with a tiny bit of discipline. Avoid taking care of others in place of yourself. If you live according to this maxim, you will ultimately be a better friend, as you will be available and strong in times of crisis and need. When we feel confident, it's tempting to give advice, or in many cases, to start taking care of others. Be careful -this can be dangerous. There is no certainty that our health tomorrow will be the same as today; we must always maintain a humble attitude and serve our bodies each day. That natural human laziness can be overcome with a tiny bit of discipline. Avoid taking care of others in place of yourself. If you live according to this maxim, you will ultimately be a better friend, as you will be available and strong in times of crisis and need. When we feel confident, it's tempting to give advice, or in many cases, to start taking care of others. Be careful -this can be dangerous. There is no