920,4,"press, beginning, pace, relatively, pacing",aries (25.0%),"1210, 2950, 19690, 21430","Pacing yourself is the name of the game. Whether you have just started an exercise regimen, or been ...","Pacing yourself is the name of the game. Whether you have just started an exercise regimen, or been at it for a while, pay attention to your pace. If you are beginning a new health practice, make it relatively easy to manage - so you can keep on doing it! Don't press yourself too hard in the beginning - remember, you are building a habit. Likewise, when you have been doing something for a while, it's important to press yourself gradually further into it (increasing the pace), so that you stay interested. Pacing yourself is the name of the game. Whether you have just started an exercise regimen, or been at it for a while, pay attention to your pace. If you are beginning a new health practice, make it relatively easy to manage - so you can keep on doing it! Don't press yourself too hard in the beginning - remember, you are building a habit. Likewise, when you have been doing something for a while, it's important to press yourself gradually further into it (increasing the pace), so that you stay interested. Pacing yourself is the name of the game. Whether you have just started an exercise regimen, or been at it for a while, pay attention to your pace. If you are beginning a new health practice, make it relatively easy to manage - so you can keep on doing it! Don't press yourself too hard in the beginning - remember, you are building a habit. Likewise, when you have been doing something for a while, it's important to press yourself gradually further into it (increasing the pace), so that you stay interested. Pacing yourself is the name of the game. Whether you have just started an exercise regimen, or been at it for a while, pay attention to your pace. If you are beginning a new health practice, make it relatively easy to manage - so you can keep on doing it! Don't press you